---
layout: base.njk
title: ABQueer West Coast Swing
---

<section class="container">

  <!-- HERO / CAROUSEL -->
  <div class="carousel">
    <div class="carousel-track" id="carousel-track">
      {% for item in carousel %}
        <img src="{{ item }}" alt="Dance photo {{ loop.index }}">
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <button class="carousel-btn carousel-prev" aria-label="Previous photo">&#8249;</button>
    <button class="carousel-btn carousel-next" aria-label="Next photo">&#8250;</button>

    <div class="carousel-dots" id="carousel-dots"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ANNUAL ELECTION -->
  <section>
    <h2 class="gradient">Annual Election</h2>

    <div class="card event-card has-image">
      <img class="event-image" src="/assets/images/elections/annaul_election.png" alt="Important Announcement! ABQueer WCS Annual Election open till Nov 10, 2026">
      <div class="event-info">
        <p class="event-date">Nominations open until November 10, 2026</p>
        <p>
          Interested in helping ABQueerWCS run? Self nominate to serve on the board or within our committees to help our mission of bringing west coast swing to the queer community and the queer community to west coast swing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Send us a private message on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/abqueerwcs/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>/<a href="https://www.facebook.com/p/ABQueer-WCS-61562844484012/" target="_blank">Facebook</a> or an email (<a href="mailto:abqueerwcs@gmail.com">abqueerwcs@gmail.com</a>) to self-nominate, ask questions, or help out!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
  <section>
    <h2 class="gradient">Why Choose Us?</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Inclusive Community</h3>
        <p>A welcoming space centered on queer joy and connection.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Beginner Friendly</h3>
        <p>No experience or partner required — just show up and dance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Fun & Social</h3>
        <p>Meet new people, build friendships, and enjoy great music.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION -->
  <section>
    <h2 class="gradient">Our Mission</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
    Albuquerque Queer West Coast Swing, Inc. (“ABQueer WCS”) is dedicated to bringing the joy of West Coast Swing to the queer community of Albuquerque, and the joy of queerness to the West Coast Swing community of Albuquerque. ABQueer WCS is committed to providing a safe, welcoming environment for everyone.
    </p>
    <p>
    Events hosted and operated by ABQueer WCS are intended for people who identify as queer, identify with the challenges queer people face in society, their loved ones, and supporters of the queer community.
  </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</section>
